y-pda-semantics\">73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Lemmas 14.1–14.3 and Theorem 14.1, pp. 379–381; scans 387–389"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed; explicit constructibility restriction"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemmas 14.1–14.3 and Theorem 14.1, pp. 379–381; scans 387–389"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed; explicit constructibility restriction"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>。可构造性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a>，辅助机类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abf2842401216bb7\" href=\"?note=abf2842401216bb7\" title=\"73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics\">73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics</a>，时间类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>。输入字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}time\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DAPDA}_{\\mathbf2}(s)=\\mathsf{NAPDA}_{\\mathbf2}(s)=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{k s(n)})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}time\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DAPDA}_{\\mathbf2}(s)=\\mathsf{NAPDA}_{\\mathbf2}(s)=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{k s(n)})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>不含栈的有限控制、输入头、工作带和工作头总配置数为指数于 s(n)。固定输入后把这些配置作为 PDA 状态，再判相应 CFG 是否非空，得到指数时间上界。反向用栈保存递归的计算历史核验任务，工作带只存指数时间的计数与局部配置参数。这里额外明确可构造性，适配本地直接预设带长的语义；这是原书定理的条件化形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"abf2842401216bb7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","status":"resolved","id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id"