A}_{\\mathbf2}(s)=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{k s(n)})","display":true}],"bytes":2400,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-auxiliary-pda-time-characterization|辅助 PDA 的确定性、非确定性与指数时间对应]]"}],"outgoing":["abf2842401216bb7","cadee7248274622b","8658210215541698"]}